OL,3,GNEWSAManx animal charity warns it is
OL,4,A'at capacity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Manx SPCA said its kennels and
OL,7,Fcattery are full and it is now asking
OL,8,Fthe public to help find homes for the
OL,9,Fanimals in its care.
OL,11,FThe charity said it had seen a "massive
OL,12,Fincrease" in cats, dogs and kittens
OL,13,Fneeding rehoming this summer, more than
OL,14,Fin previous years.
OL,16,FKrish Boruch, who dedicates all her
OL,17,Ftime to the care of the animals, is now
OL,18,Furging people thinking of getting a pet
OL,19,Fto adopt rather than buy cheaply
OL,20,Fadvertised animals on social media.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
